{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-11-03 09:05:00', 'title': 'TSMC RECOGNIZES LONG-STANDING COLLABORATION WITH SYNOPSYS ON SEMICONDUCTOR INNOVATION WITH MULTIPLE OIP PARTNER OF THE YEAR AWARDS', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FOR THE ELEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, IT HAS BEEN SELECTED AS A TSMC OPEN INNOVATION PLATFORM® (OIP) PARTNER OF THE YEAR, SPOTLIGHTING A LONG-STANDING COLLABORATION TO ADVANCE NEXT-GENERATION SYSTEM-ON-CHIP (SOC) AND 3DIC DESIGN ENABLEMENT.'}